@startuml notification
' AI-generated draft. Not reviewed. Not rendered: PlantUML was unavailable when authored.
title Notifications (proposal)\nFR-017, FR-019, FR-023. In-app only (ID-08); FR-018 is Post-MVP. Draft pending human review

participant "ExpenseService\nApprovalService" as Caller
participant "NotificationDispatcher" as Disp
participant "MembershipRepository" as Members
participant "NotificationRepository" as Repo
actor "Recipient" as User
participant "HomePanel" as Home
participant "NotificationsPanel" as Panel
participant "NotificationController" as Ctrl
participant "NotificationService" as Svc
participant "AccessPolicy" as Access

== New expense, inside the creating transaction. FR-017, AD-09 ==

Caller -> Disp : expenseCreated(expense)
Disp -> Members : listActiveMembers(group)
Members --> Disp : current members only
note right of Disp
  Recipients: every current member except the creator.
  Former members receive nothing (Scenario 7.4).
  Content snapshot: creator, group, description, amount, date.
end note
Disp -> Repo : insertAll(notifications)
note right of Repo : Commits together with the expense,\nso it cannot be lost after a save (SC-006)

== Decision, inside the deciding transaction. FR-023 ==

Caller -> Disp : expenseDecided(expense, decision)
Disp -> Repo : insertAll(one notification to the creator, with reason if rejected)

== At login and on return to Home. FR-019 ==

User -> Home : log in or return to Home
Home -> Ctrl : refresh
Ctrl -> Svc : unreadCount(session)
Svc -> Access : visibleGroupScope(session)
Svc -> Repo : countUnread(user, scope)
Repo --> Svc : count
Svc --> Ctrl : count
Ctrl --> Home : show unread count
note right of Home : Notifications from while logged out appear here.\nOne session at a time, so no polling (AD-24).

== Open the list. FR-019 ==

User -> Panel : open Notifications
Panel -> Ctrl : load
Ctrl -> Svc : list(session)
Svc -> Repo : listForRecipient(user, scope)
Repo --> Svc : rows, newest first
note right of Svc
  FR-017: needsApproval is derived on each read:
    type = NEW_EXPENSE
    and expense is PENDING
    and recipient is a participant other than the creator
  Never stored, so it disappears once decided.
end note
Svc --> Ctrl : NotificationView list
Ctrl --> Panel : render

== Mark read. FR-019 ==

User -> Panel : mark read
Panel -> Ctrl : selected ids
Ctrl -> Svc : markRead(session, ids)
Svc -> Repo : markRead(user, ids, now)
note right of Repo : Restricted to the recipient's own rows

@enduml
